  "description": "In a desperate moment when he falls off a cliff, chased by suspicious people, Damian is caught in a dazzling light and falls to country K. As soon as he regains consciousness, Damian saves Yedam, who was in danger after being caught by a stalker, and somehow ends up living with Yedam...\n\nThe unpredictable, uncommunicative life of two people living together, and romance! A prince from another world lives in our house~!\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
